"P449847547" "You found some alien combat drugs and received an inspiration"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2506335300" "You beat the raiders and the Lost and stole the medicines."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3583122485" "Hope those alien medicines worked for you. There's still a lot more to go. And don't worry about what you took for yourself. Keep what you take, that's the Arachnos way."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
