// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2839269252" "The Sky Raiders are ranging pretty far from the Islands for their next operation. I hope you hate the Council, because you're going to Striga Island. It's the Council's little stronghold where they hatch their plots and make their monsters. Colonel Duray wants to learn the secrets of their superhuman enhancement programs, and apparently, the Center is willing to sell it to the Sky Raiders in exchange for some mercenary work. Now, we can't allow that. They can't be allowed to have that technology after all the trouble they caused, and you're being sent to Striga to stop them."
// AcceptString :
"P3258536172" "Travel to Striga Island to Stop Sky Raiders from buying Council technology"
// SendOffString :
"P2380310675" "Striga is an interesting place. Unfortunately, this will have to be quiet, since the Raiders aren't technically stealing anything yet, and we have other plans against the Council we can't disturb. You'll be going in under the radar and will be dropped into the ventilation shafts. Hopefully, you'll be able to catch the Sky Raiders before they can complete the deal. Defeat the ones making the deal. That should be Captain Drake of the Sky Raiders and Ascendant Tiger. You'll also need to defeat their cronies, and while you're at it, destroy all the chambers they're using for their Vampyr transformation process. I mean, can't leave any loose ends."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2296638973" "Stop Negotiations"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1955538302" "You're supposed to be on Striga! What are you doing wasting time back here?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1537505810" "Even as a villain, you know this place feels wrong."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2013856717" "Don't you think it's weird? <em>You know. We're the Sky Raiders, but we're not actually stealing anything here. <em> I mean, it just feels wrong to me not to be stealing stuff."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P703508478" "What's weird? <em>Well... Yeah. <em>Huh. <em>Now that I think about it, you do have a point."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P871845575" "Hey, you're not supposed to be here!"

