// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2287619512" "Duray's next target is a Crey facility in New Haven. Rumors are Crey moved a lot of strange things in there. I'm really curious what Duray thinks they have. Of course, if something were to happen to every last one of the personel at that place during a Sky Raider attack gone horribly awry, well then, there would be no one around to complain if we take a look for ourselves. <br><br>Hmmm... <br><br>I like how that works. We stop a Sky Raider heist and get a peek at what Crey is up to; and the only 'cost' is the pleasure of wiping out a Crey base. Sounds like a win-win to me. I can't wait to hear all about what you find."
// AcceptString :
"P2627494076" "Take out Sky Raiders and the base they're raiding."
// SendOffString :
"P2013216466" "No one knows what's in that facility but Countess Crey and Duray. I can't wait to learn what you find out. Just take out everyone. I think you'll enjoy it. It should be fun! We do know that whatever is going on in there, it's a pretty big installation. So, be ready for a long fight."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3426146478" "Defeat everyone in Crey Facility"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1612152220" "I don't understand you. Why are you waiting? There are spines to break and heads to smash! Go on and do it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4218005048" "You followed the Sky Raider attackers in through blasted corporate offices above, and entered the underground complex."

