// Dialog :
"P762380504" "Your team has defeated Colonel Duray, the leader of the Sky Raiders."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P745917414" "Your team destroyed the Sky Raider sea base and defeated Colonel Duray"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P241562049" "And so fall the Pirates of the Skies. The Sky Raiders themselves are scattered. I'm sure they'll regroup in time. <br><br>We fished Duray out of the water, and are holding him now. There's so much he can tell us, whether he wants to or not. We've already learned some fun new facts about the Rikti and the Nemesis Army from him. <br><br>I'm sure the Sky Raiders will rally and try to break him out, once they've had time to regroup. You might want to watch out for that. It's in our best interests for the Colonel to escape eventually, or so I'm told. Balance of the Islands or something. Not that I care. <br><br>And you, you've earned your pay. The real joy's in the mayhem, I always say, but the money isn't half bad, either."
// RandomFameString :
"P229777770" "I heard a group of rogues calling themselves {Task Force Name} blew up a Sky Raider base!"

